WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:11.206
Aunt Sunny and Uncle Tom are back from their honeymoon.

2
00:00:11.207 --> 00:00:15.869
They took us on a cable car ride across San Francisco.

3
00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:19.988
We had so much fun!

4
00:00:19.989 --> 00:00:23.046
Hana: Can we ride a cable car?

5
00:00:23.047 --> 00:00:26.063
Sunny: Yes, here comes one now!

6
00:00:26.064 --> 00:00:28.127
Mom: How much is the fare?

7
00:00:28.128 --> 00:00:31.787
Tom: Don't worry. It's on us.

8
00:00:31.788 --> 00:00:36.800
Hana: Wow! San Francisco is so beautiful!

9
00:00:36.801 --> 00:00:38.234
Sunny: Yes, it is.

10
00:00:38.235 --> 00:00:41.102
Look! That's City Hall.

11
00:00:41.103 --> 00:00:44.248
Bada: Where? I can't see.

12
00:00:44.249 --> 00:00:45.879
Tom: Be careful, Bada.

13
00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:48.402
Hang on tight!

14
00:00:48.403 --> 00:00:50.349
Sunny: This is our stop.

15
00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:53.332
Tom: This place is called Fisherman's Wharf.

16
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:55.497
Hana: What is that sound?

17
00:00:55.498 --> 00:00:59.533
Sunny: That must be the sea lions.

18
00:00:59.534 --> 00:01:03.435
Hana: Look! Look at all those sea lions!

19
00:01:03.436 --> 00:01:08.397
Mom: Oh my! There must be at least a hundred of them.

20
00:01:08.398 --> 00:01:14.095
Bada: Wow! I never saw a sea lion before!

21
00:01:14.096 --> 00:01:17.615
Tom: We have to get back on the cable car again.

22
00:01:17.616 --> 00:01:20.196
Hana: What's that man doing?

23
00:01:20.197 --> 00:01:25.431
Tom: He is turning the cable car around so that [n3@it can go in the opposite direction.

24
00:01:25.432 --> 00:01:28.793
Sunny: He's called a gripman.

25
00:01:28.794 --> 00:01:31.173
Gripman: Does anyone want to help me?

26
00:01:31.174 --> 00:01:33.850
Hana & Bada: Me! Me!

27
00:01:33.851 --> 00:01:38.146
Gripman: Okay, now, Push! Push!

28
00:01:38.147 --> 00:01:42.431
Thanks for your help! All aboard!

29
00:01:42.432 --> 00:01:44.896
Mom: Did you have a good time today?

30
00:01:44.897 --> 00:01:48.323
Hana: Yes. It was a lot of fun.

31
00:01:48.324 --> 00:01:52.445
Mom: I'm glad. And what about you, Bada?

32
00:01:52.446 --> 00:01:56.684
Sunny: Looks like someone is ready for bed.

33
00:01:56.685 --> 00:02:03.009
Bada was so excited to ride the cable car and see many other things.

34
00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:08.266
He was very happy but also very tired.

35
00:02:08.267 --> 00:02:12.432
So am I.
